"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "{worriedA}{body-standA}Bigby cares, Holly. He's trying to help."
},
{
"k": "17964",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "{sadb}But this one wasn't his fault."
},
{
"k": "17965",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "[a little nervous] {worriedA}{body-standA}I won't... um, offend you... {body-hands}by claiming one day that... that the pain of losing Lily will ever subside."
},
{
"k": "17966",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "{sadA}{body-handsfront}I know as well as you that it will never subside."
},
{
"k": "17967",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "But I also know that-- that the memory of Lily will sustain as well."
},
{
"k": "17968",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "And it will, in time. . . equal in strength to our mourning her loss."
},
{
"k": "17969",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "And it is in that spirit that I'd like to talk about my own memories of Lily."
},
{
"k": "17970",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "I worked with Lily."
},
{
"k": "17971",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "I remember her stubbornness. Her passion."
},
{
"k": "17972",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "How she could be rash and thoughtful at the same time."
},
{
"k": "17973",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "I remember her love of White Russians."
},
{
"k": "17974",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "The drink and the men."
},
{
"k": "17975",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "But most of all, I remember how much she loved people, and to be around them, in good times and bad."
},
{
"k": "17976",
"who": "VIVIAN",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "She'd have liked to be here tonight."
},
{
"k": "17977",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "{worriedA}{body-handsfront}And now, we'll have our, {thinkingB}um, {worriedA}moment of silence. {happyA}Thank you."
},
{
"k": "17978",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "{sadA}{body-handsfront}But I also know that-- that the memory of Lily will sustain as well."
},
{
"k": "17979",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "{sadA}{body-handsfront}And it will, in time... {sadB}equal in strength to our mourning her loss."
},
{
"k": "17980",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "{body-handsfront}{worriedA}And it is in that spirit that I'd like to talk about... {happyA}{body-hands}what you've all been so grateful to share with me."
},
{
"k": "17981",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "{body-handsfront}{happyA}Your memories of her."
},
{
"k": "17982",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "{body-hands}{happyA}How she could be stubborn, and... patient. Rash and thoughtful."
},
{
"k": "17983",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "{body-hands}{normalA}How she carried a torch for the \"old ways\", for tradition, for{thinkingA}... um, {happyA}pageantry."
},
{
"k": "17984",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables103/env_buckinghambridge_fight",
"en": "{worriedA}{body-hands}And most of all , it seems, how... Lily loved -- {happyA}{body-handsfront}dearly loved -- her friends and family."
}
]